  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "こがたの　ドラゴンポケモン。ヘイラッシャの　くちのなかに　すみがいてきから　みを　まもっている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "작은 몸집의 드래곤포켓몬. 어써러셔의 입안에 살며 외부의 적으로부터 몸을 지킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "小型的龍寶可夢。會住在吃吼霸嘴裡，保護自己免於外敵襲擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce petit Pokémon Dragon vit dans la gueule d’Oyacata, à l’abri de ses adversaires.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses kleine Drachen-Pokémon lebt im Maul von Heerashai, wodurch es vor Feinden geschützt ist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pokémon dragón de pequeño tamaño. Vive en la boca de un Dondozo para protegerse de los ataques de los depredadores.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon di tipo Drago di piccole dimensioni. Vive all’interno della bocca di Dondozo, protetto dagli attacchi dei nemici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This is a small dragon Pokémon. It lives inside the mouth of Dondozo to protect itself from enemies on the outside.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "小型の　ドラゴンポケモン。ヘイラッシャの　口の中に　棲み外敵から　身を　守っている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "小型的龙宝可梦。会住在吃吼霸嘴里，保护自己免于外敌袭击。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pokémon dragón de pequeño tamaño. Vive en la boca de un Dondozo para protegerse de los ataques de los depredadores.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひじょうに　わるがしこい　ポケモン。よわったふりで　えものを　おびきよせなかまの　ポケモンに　おそわせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "매우 교활한 포켓몬이다. 약해진 척하며 먹잇감을 유인하고는 동료 포켓몬이 공격하게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "極為奸詐狡猾的寶可夢。會假裝虛弱來吸引獵物接近，接著讓同夥的寶可夢發動攻擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Très rusé, il fait mine d’être vulnérable et attire ainsi des proies qui se font ensuite attaquer par son redoutable partenaire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses äußerst gerissene Pokémon gibt vor, geschwächt zu sein, um so Beute anzulocken, die sein Partner daraufhin angreift.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es un Pokémon de gran astucia. Atrae a sus presas fingiendo estar débil para otorgarle a su compañero la oportunidad de atacar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È un Pokémon estremamente astuto. Attira la preda fingendosi stremato, lasciando che sia il suo alleato ad attaccarla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tatsugiri is an extremely cunning Pokémon. It feigns weakness to lure in prey, then orders its partner to attack.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常に　悪賢い　ポケモン。弱ったふりで　獲物を　おびき寄せ仲間の　ポケモンに　襲わせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常狡猾奸诈的宝可梦。会假装虚弱来吸引猎物接近，接着让自己同伙的宝可梦发动攻击。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es un Pokémon de gran astucia. Atrae a sus presas fingiendo estar débil para otorgarle a su compañero la oportunidad de atacar.",
